BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sikinos-chora-kastro-panigiri-of-zoodochos-pigi-monastery-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270506
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270508
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Zoodochos Pigi monastery\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora (Kastro)\, Sikinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fortified 17th-century monastery above Kastro celebrates on Bright Friday\, the first Friday after Easter: on the eve the sponsoring family lays on a communal meal at the monastery for the whole village\, and in return keeps the icon in their house for the year. It's the island's spring feast and\, with the Easter week\, the best reason to come to Sikinos out of season\; climb the steps from Kastro before dusk.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-kastro-panigiri-of-zoodochos-pigi-monastery-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-kastro-panigiri-of-zoodochos-pigi-monastery-chora
END:VEVENT
