BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sikinos-profitis-ilias-chapel-countryside-profitis-ilias-feast-sikin-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Profitis Ilias feast\, Sikinos chapel
LOCATION:Profitis Ilias chapel (countryside)\, Sikinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The municipality organises a proper panigiri at the hill chapel of Profitis Ilias on 20 July\, with musicians\, food and dancing for locals and visitors together — the mayor's own posts confirm it as an annual fixture. The chapel is reached on foot from the Chora–Episkopi road\; take water and a torch for the way down.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#profitis-ilias-chapel-countryside-profitis-ilias-feast-sikin
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#profitis-ilias-chapel-countryside-profitis-ilias-feast-sikin
END:VEVENT
