BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sikinos-chora-panigiri-of-stavros-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270913
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270915
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Stavros\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Sikinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:For the Exaltation of the Cross the sponsoring family gives an evening meal for the village on 13 September and\, as with every Sikinos feast\, takes the icon home for a year. It's a quiet\, entirely local evening at the end of the season — the sort of thing you stumble on rather than plan around\, but worth knowing if you're on the island in mid-September.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-panigiri-of-stavros-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-panigiri-of-stavros-chora
END:VEVENT
